# Generated per-candidate verifier outputs from the ablation sweep.
#
# These are the evidence that the calibration is real, but each candidate writes
# a full copy of the deliverable tables, so the directory reaches ~13.5 MB here
# and would grow the repository by an order of magnitude across the suite for
# content that is reproducible on demand. The scored summary that a reviewer
# actually needs -- which candidate passed, which single defect failed, and on
# which statistic -- lives in authoring/evidence/ablations.md and is committed.
#
# Regenerate with: python3 authoring/evidence/measure_ablations.py
authoring/evidence/candidates/
